spice
* Components
* Transistors
M_Q1 2 1 6 6 NMOS
M_Q2 5 13 2 2 NMOS
M_Q3 5 12 5 5 PMOS
M_Q4 9 11 5 5 PMOS
M_Q5 9 11 3 3 PMOS
M_Q6 5 10 5 5 PMOS

* Voltage Sources
V1 8 0 DC VBB
V+ 9 4 DC 5V

* Current Source
I1 5 0 DC

* Nodes
* 1: Input voltage node (V1)
* 2: Connection between Q1, Q2
* 3: Connection between Q5 gate and others
* 4: Supply voltage for Q4 and Q5
* 5: Output node (Vo)
* 6: Ground connection for Q1
* 9: Supply voltage V+
* 10: Q6 gate connection
* 11: Q4/Q5 common gate/source connection
* 12: Q3 gate connection
* 13: VBias input